# The Mothercrystals, the Hall's zone-in without its event (CoP 1-3). 1-3 current. The lights of Holla and Mea (two lights,
# GMs), Status 1 (a GM): the Hall from Konschtat (no light of Dem): Status is not 0: nothing. Status 0 and the light of Dem
# added (three lights, GMs): nothing. The light of Mea taken (two lights, Dem's held): the Hall from Konschtat: the
# previous crag's light is held: nothing. The Hall from the Spire of Dem (not a telepoint zone), two lights: nothing.
lists HallOfTransference/onZoneIn/1
char zone=KonschtatHighlands pos=135,19,220 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop TheMothercrystals current
keyitem LightOfHolla
keyitem LightOfMea
charvar Mission[6][128]Status 1
login
warp -267.194,-40.634,-280.019 HallOfTransference   # Status 1: nothing
charvar Mission[6][128]Status 0         # a GM
keyitem LightOfDem                      # a GM: three lights
warp 135,19,220 KonschtatHighlands
warp -267.194,-40.634,-280.019 HallOfTransference   # three lights: nothing
delkeyitem LightOfMea                   # a GM: two lights, Dem's held
warp 135,19,220 KonschtatHighlands
warp -267.194,-40.634,-280.019 HallOfTransference   # Dem's light held: nothing
warp 0,-3.8,240 SpireOfDem
warp -236.3,-4.9,290 HallOfTransference             # not a telepoint zone: nothing
